    <sys:String x:Key="Str_AboutTitle">About TidyFlow</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_AboutTagline">Smart Windows file organizer, list-based batch renamer, duplicate finder, disk cleaner, image resizer, and folder watcher.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_AboutAuthor">Author: Thang Huynh · License: MIT Open Source</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_AboutGuideTitle">Quick Feature Guide</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Str_AboutGuideBody">• Organize Folder: Sort Downloads or any folder by Type, Date (EXIF), or custom AND/OR rules.
• List Batch Rename: Paste a custom list of names, reorder files, or use Windows OCR Suggest.
• Duplicate Finder: Scan identical files via SHA-256 and move duplicates safely to Recycle Bin.
• Space Cleaner: Inspect largest files, subfolder usage, and remove empty folders.
• Image Resizer: Resize (fit, center-crop, stretch, %) or convert JPG/PNG/BMP/TIFF in bulk.
• Automation &amp; Tools: Background Watch Folder in System Tray &amp; Explorer right-click menu.
• Smart OCR &amp; AI: Extract text from images or organize folders using plain-English instructions.</sys:String>
